
@startuml
title Projectory - Interactive 3D Project Showcase
autonumber

actor Student
actor Viewer
participant "React Frontend" as React
participant "FastAPI Backend" as API
database "PostgreSQL / Supabase" as DB
participant "3D Model Storage" as Storage
participant "3D Viewer" as ModelViewer

== Attach 3D Model ==

Student -> React: Open existing project
Student -> React: Select 3D model file
React -> API: Submit model attachment request

API -> API: Check authorization and validate format

alt Unsupported format or unauthorized
    API --> React: Return error
    React --> Student: Display error message
else Valid model
    API -> Storage: Store 3D model file
    Storage --> API: Return model reference
    API -> DB: Associate model metadata with project
    DB --> API: Confirm association
    API --> React: Return success
    React --> Student: Show attached model
end

== View 3D Model ==

Viewer -> React: Open project page
React -> API: Request project and 3D model information
API -> DB: Retrieve project and model metadata
DB --> API: Return project and model reference
API --> React: Return project information

React -> ModelViewer: Load model using reference
ModelViewer -> Storage: Request model asset

alt Model unavailable or loading fails
    Storage --> ModelViewer: Error
    ModelViewer --> React: Loading failure
    React --> Viewer: Display error message
else Model loaded successfully
    Storage --> ModelViewer: Model asset
    ModelViewer --> React: Rendered model ready
    React --> Viewer: Display interactive 3D model

    Viewer -> ModelViewer: Rotate or zoom
    ModelViewer --> Viewer: Update model view
end

@enduml
